WEBVTT

00:00:33.650 --> 00:00:34.820
<i>Amazing!</i>

00:00:34.950 --> 00:00:36.910
<i>It flew up so high!</i>

00:00:37.120 --> 00:00:39.490
<i>Next up is Chika-chan.</i>

00:00:39.950 --> 00:00:40.910
<i>All right.</i>

00:00:41.200 --> 00:00:42.290
<i>I can do it too.</i>

00:00:42.620 --> 00:00:43.500
<i>Go!</i>

00:00:44.710 --> 00:00:47.830
<i>I think it should have
flown a little higher.</i>

00:00:48.040 --> 00:00:49.460
<i>Chika-chan, try again.</i>

00:00:49.630 --> 00:00:51.130
<i>Have another go!</i>

00:00:51.630 --> 00:00:52.510
<i>Okay!</i>

00:01:09.480 --> 00:01:10.440
<i>Is this...</i>

00:01:10.570 --> 00:01:11.440
<i>...yours?</i>

00:01:11.570 --> 00:01:13.360
<i>Yep. That's right.</i>

00:01:18.240 --> 00:01:19.620
<i>Can you fly it higher?</i>

00:01:20.240 --> 00:01:21.290
<i>I sure can.</i>

00:01:21.490 --> 00:01:22.370
<i>Much higher.</i>

00:01:22.910 --> 00:01:24.870
<i>I'll make it fly past the rainbow!</i>

00:01:25.810 --> 00:01:29.810
Bus Stop

00:01:25.810 --> 00:01:29.810
Uranohoshi
Girls' High School
(Front)

00:01:38.510 --> 00:01:39.970
We danced well.

00:01:40.390 --> 00:01:41.350
One more time!

00:01:41.600 --> 00:01:45.390
In this school, together
with everyone from Aqours!

00:01:45.600 --> 00:01:46.520
You know what?

00:01:46.600 --> 00:01:48.350
We have something to say.

00:01:48.440 --> 00:01:50.270
- To Chika...
- And everyone else.

00:01:50.520 --> 00:01:53.320
- Something you want to say?
- What Is It?
- Zura?

00:01:53.440 --> 00:01:54.360
That's right!

00:01:54.530 --> 00:01:59.990
This is regarding our future as the
third year students and Aqours too.

00:02:00.620 --> 00:02:01.990
The future.

00:02:04.400 --> 00:02:06.050
Sou desu!

00:02:04.400 --> 00:02:06.050
That's right!

00:02:06.050 --> 00:02:12.290
Kagayakitakute hajimaritakutte

00:02:06.050 --> 00:02:12.290
I always wanted to shine
I wanted to make it all start

00:02:12.290 --> 00:02:18.580
Nakama ni deai nagara hashitte kita michi

00:02:12.290 --> 00:02:18.580
While meeting friends along the way
we've come to run down a path

00:02:18.580 --> 00:02:26.800
Zero kara ichi tte nante taihen nandaro

00:02:18.580 --> 00:02:26.800
Starting from scratch towards a one
how difficult could that really be?

00:02:26.800 --> 00:02:39.410
Dakedo sore ga (dakedo sore ga) tsunagari ni natta yo

00:02:26.800 --> 00:02:39.410
But what happened then (But what happened then)
that became a connection

00:02:39.410 --> 00:02:40.910
Sou desu!

00:02:39.410 --> 00:02:40.910
That's right!

00:02:40.910 --> 00:02:46.440
Nani mo wakarazu namida to ase to de

00:02:40.910 --> 00:02:46.440
I didn't understand it
and went through tears and sweat

00:02:46.440 --> 00:02:51.780
Nakama to hagemashi atte hashitte kita michi

00:02:46.440 --> 00:02:51.780
My friends encouraged me
and we've come to this path

00:02:51.780 --> 00:02:58.520
Oozora miagete katariatta yo mainichi

00:02:51.780 --> 00:02:58.520
Look up the grand and blue sky
in a day to day I want to tell

00:02:58.520 --> 00:03:06.370
Dakara minna (dakara minna) ganbatte koreta ne

00:02:58.520 --> 00:03:06.370
That's why we all (That's why we all)
got ourselves giving our all!

00:03:06.370 --> 00:03:13.260
Itsumo yume ga kokoro ni atta

00:03:06.370 --> 00:03:13.260
Always my dreams are inside my heart

00:03:13.260 --> 00:03:18.260
Miushinaisou ni natte mo

00:03:13.260 --> 00:03:18.260
Even if I start to loose their sight

00:03:18.260 --> 00:03:24.290
Bokura zettai akiramenai!

00:03:18.260 --> 00:03:24.290
And that's why we are never giving up!

00:03:24.290 --> 00:03:27.010
Datte hikari ga mieta yo

00:03:24.290 --> 00:03:27.010
Because we finally saw that light

00:03:27.010 --> 00:03:37.620
Motto muchuu ni naretara kawaru tte sa shinjiteta

00:03:27.010 --> 00:03:37.620
Even if I became a bit obsessed
I believed It'd change, I believed it

00:03:38.940 --> 00:03:43.000
Kono minna de

00:03:38.940 --> 00:03:43.000
With all of you

00:03:56.960 --> 00:03:58.470
Sou desu!

00:03:56.960 --> 00:03:58.470
That's right!

00:03:58.470 --> 00:04:03.900
Hitotsu futatsu to negai ga kanatte

00:03:58.470 --> 00:04:03.900
One after another,
all my wishes came true

00:04:03.900 --> 00:04:09.160
Nakama ga ite yokatta natte hashitte kita michi

00:04:03.900 --> 00:04:09.160
It was nice to have met all my friends
and going down this path

00:04:10.110 --> 00:04:16.050
Demo ne wakare wa donna koto ni mo arunda

00:04:10.110 --> 00:04:16.050
But you see
there's an end to everything we have started

00:04:16.050 --> 00:04:23.820
Doko e ikou (doko e ikou) sorezore no gooru e

00:04:16.050 --> 00:04:23.820
So where should we go? (Where should we go?)
obviously to our goal!

00:04:23.820 --> 00:04:30.730
Sara ni hashirou sore shikanai to

00:04:23.820 --> 00:04:30.730
So all, let's run even further than now

00:04:30.730 --> 00:04:35.780
Omotteru kedo nayamu ne

00:04:30.730 --> 00:04:35.780
Despite all my care I'm still worried

00:04:35.780 --> 00:04:41.720
Bokura zettai tomarenai yo

00:04:35.780 --> 00:04:41.720
And that's why we are never going to stop!

00:04:41.720 --> 00:04:44.570
Datte kanjitai atsuku

00:04:41.720 --> 00:04:44.570
Because I want to feel that warmth
and in a very different form

00:04:44.570 --> 00:04:54.610
Motto chigatta katachi de atarashiku yume mite

00:04:44.570 --> 00:04:54.610
A new dream I want to see

00:04:54.610 --> 00:04:57.610
Aa doushiyou (ashita e)

00:04:54.610 --> 00:04:57.610
Aah, what should we do? (Thinking ahead)

00:04:57.610 --> 00:05:00.560
Aa doushiyou (muka e ba)

00:04:57.610 --> 00:05:00.560
Aah, what should we do? (Where should we head?)

00:05:00.560 --> 00:05:06.590
Wakaru? Wakaru? Mirai no bokura wa...?

00:05:00.560 --> 00:05:06.590
Can you see? Can you tell?
Our future selves do...?

00:05:28.510 --> 00:05:30.420
Sou desu…

00:05:28.510 --> 00:05:30.420
That's right

00:05:30.420 --> 00:05:37.330
Jibun rashiku to jumon o tonaete

00:05:30.420 --> 00:05:37.330
As expected from myself
I tried to cast a spell

00:05:37.330 --> 00:05:45.800
Nakama o miokuru koto o ukeire nagara mo

00:05:37.330 --> 00:05:45.800
Accepting that I should see them all off,
my dear friends, with sorrow

00:05:46.990 --> 00:05:54.000
Zero janai daijoubu! Genki dasou waraou yo

00:05:46.990 --> 00:05:54.000
It's not the end, it's all right,
let's cheer up, let's laugh it off!

00:05:54.000 --> 00:06:01.810
Yatte miyou yatte miyou madamada ne ganbaru

00:05:54.000 --> 00:06:01.810
I want to see if (I want to see if)
we can still give it some more!

00:06:01.810 --> 00:06:08.800
Sara ni hashirou sore shikanai to

00:06:01.810 --> 00:06:08.800
So all, let's run even further than now

00:06:08.800 --> 00:06:13.780
Omotteru kara hashiru yo

00:06:08.800 --> 00:06:13.780
Despite all my care I'm still worried

00:06:13.780 --> 00:06:19.780
Bokura zettai tomarenai yo

00:06:13.780 --> 00:06:19.780
And that's why we are never going to stop!

00:06:19.780 --> 00:06:22.610
Datte kanjitai atsuku

00:06:19.780 --> 00:06:22.610
Because I want to feel that warmth
and in a very different form

00:06:22.610 --> 00:06:31.630
Motto chigatta katachi de atarashiku yumemite

00:06:22.610 --> 00:06:31.630
A new dream I want to see

00:06:31.630 --> 00:06:37.680
Saa maku ga agattara zutto utatte itai ne

00:06:31.630 --> 00:06:37.680
So when the curtain rises up
we are going to sing forever

00:06:37.680 --> 00:06:46.080
Owaranai yume miyou...

00:06:37.680 --> 00:06:46.080
And an endless dream we will see!

00:07:17.850 --> 00:07:19.020
Have they left?

00:07:20.520 --> 00:07:21.480
All right.

00:07:21.600 --> 00:07:23.900
Let's go back and practice!

00:07:24.360 --> 00:07:25.320
That's right.

00:07:25.440 --> 00:07:29.360
Although the six of us will go to
a new school, Aqours will continue.

00:07:31.450 --> 00:07:32.410
That's right.

00:07:32.860 --> 00:07:34.570
It was a unanimous decision!

00:07:34.950 --> 00:07:37.240
- You seem motivated, zura.
- Giran!

00:07:39.040 --> 00:07:41.080
As usual, you really don't
get what's going on, zura.

00:07:41.210 --> 00:07:42.500
You're so annoying!

00:07:44.540 --> 00:07:45.500
What's wrong?

00:07:45.630 --> 00:07:46.590
Where...

00:07:46.960 --> 00:07:48.250
are we going to practice?

00:07:48.380 --> 00:07:50.840
Do you have to ask?
It's at the usual place.

00:07:52.130 --> 00:07:53.090
Oh, that's right.

00:07:53.220 --> 00:07:55.010
We can't use the school.

00:07:55.550 --> 00:07:57.850
What about the practice space
in front of the station?

00:07:57.970 --> 00:08:01.270
We agreed to use it only
until the Love Live! competition.

00:08:01.890 --> 00:08:04.020
What? So what should we do, zura?

00:08:04.150 --> 00:08:06.060
Should we try asking Mari?

00:08:06.310 --> 00:08:08.400
Maybe she knows
a place we can use.

00:08:09.820 --> 00:08:10.780
Chika-chan?

00:08:11.400 --> 00:08:13.280
Let's look for a place by ourselves.

00:08:15.160 --> 00:08:16.070
I feel as if...

00:08:16.490 --> 00:08:18.870
...things won't work out
if we rely on others.

00:08:18.990 --> 00:08:21.120
We're starting over with
us six members, after all.

00:08:21.250 --> 00:08:23.160
So, we have to work it out
between the six of us!

00:08:27.000 --> 00:08:28.130
Don't you agree?

00:08:30.510 --> 00:08:31.460
Yes.

00:08:32.670 --> 00:08:33.550
I know!

00:08:33.840 --> 00:08:34.800
What is it, You-chan?

00:08:35.510 --> 00:08:38.390
How about going to
see our new school?

00:08:38.430 --> 00:08:40.430
We're starting there in spring.

00:08:42.270 --> 00:08:43.140
New...

00:08:44.600 --> 00:08:45.810
...school?

00:08:49.400 --> 00:08:51.070
It's quite far away, isn't it?

00:08:51.230 --> 00:08:55.030
It seems like a big school,
judging from the number of students.

00:08:56.070 --> 00:08:57.200
Huh?

00:08:57.740 --> 00:09:00.240
Is there really a school here?

00:09:10.710 --> 00:09:11.670
What?

00:09:11.800 --> 00:09:13.840
It's... it's so old, zura.

00:09:13.970 --> 00:09:16.090
You, did you make a mistake?

00:09:17.470 --> 00:09:20.180
But it's in the message
the school sent us.

00:09:20.310 --> 00:09:25.750
Seishin High School

00:09:20.310 --> 00:09:25.750
Uranohoshi Girls' High School branch school

00:09:20.600 --> 00:09:25.750
"Uranohoshi students
must gather here for the entrance ceremony."

00:09:27.150 --> 00:09:30.130
Seishin High School

00:09:27.150 --> 00:09:30.130
Uranohoshi Girls' High School branch school

00:09:28.710 --> 00:09:29.750
Look!

00:09:30.940 --> 00:09:32.440
Branch school?!

00:09:34.490 --> 00:09:35.780
This is unacceptable!

00:09:36.150 --> 00:09:38.280
It seems that some
don't wish to be...

00:09:38.450 --> 00:09:41.120
...associated with
Uranohoshi High School.

00:09:41.280 --> 00:09:45.210
So, they want to run it as a
branch school for the time being.

00:09:45.500 --> 00:09:47.870
For that reason, they
borrowed a primary school...

00:09:48.000 --> 00:09:50.290
...that was not in use
for the Uranohoshi students.

00:09:50.460 --> 00:09:52.960
And they had only
one class until now.

00:09:53.210 --> 00:09:56.300
We may be restructuring, but being
transferred to a school that's closing down...

00:09:56.340 --> 00:09:58.220
...is pointless, isn't it, zura?

00:09:58.470 --> 00:10:00.970
And if the third year students graduate...

00:10:01.010 --> 00:10:03.970
...and are put in the same
classroom as Ruby...

00:10:06.350 --> 00:10:08.140
<i>Good mor...</i>

00:10:09.350 --> 00:10:10.160
<i>...ning?</i>

00:10:10.520 --> 00:10:13.070
<i>Welcome to Hell Zone.</i>

00:10:16.860 --> 00:10:17.990
What do you mean?

00:10:18.200 --> 00:10:19.990
We can't study like that.

00:10:20.160 --> 00:10:21.990
School Idol activities
can't be carried out either.

00:10:23.330 --> 00:10:26.250
But why were there protests
about being in the same school?

00:10:29.170 --> 00:10:30.330
Come to think of it,

00:10:30.500 --> 00:10:32.000
where is You-chan, zura?

00:10:33.840 --> 00:10:35.840
Oh yeah, you're right...

00:10:35.960 --> 00:10:37.010
She's not here, is she?

00:10:37.170 --> 00:10:39.510
She was sitting over
there a while ago.

00:10:39.930 --> 00:10:41.930
Unless I'm mistaken,
she had a call...

00:10:44.180 --> 00:10:45.180
No way.

00:10:47.520 --> 00:10:48.520
Zura?

00:10:51.150 --> 00:10:52.690
What's wrong?

00:10:54.650 --> 00:10:57.030
T-There's nothin to see, zura.

00:10:57.190 --> 00:11:00.360
The little demon was
just making a ruckus.

00:11:00.490 --> 00:11:01.870
Calm down.

00:11:02.370 --> 00:11:04.030
What are you hiding?

00:11:04.200 --> 00:11:06.200
That's right. What did you see?

00:11:06.370 --> 00:11:08.710
Nothing. Nothing, truly!

00:11:08.870 --> 00:11:11.370
- It's better for you not to see.
- That's right, zura!

00:11:13.080 --> 00:11:14.630
And why's that?

00:11:18.210 --> 00:11:19.220
She probably...

00:11:19.380 --> 00:11:22.220
...found us some cute outfits!

00:11:22.550 --> 00:11:24.550
W-Wait!

00:11:42.410 --> 00:11:43.410
A dream?

00:11:44.910 --> 00:11:47.410
That's right, this is a dream.

00:11:49.910 --> 00:11:51.410
That's right, it's a dream.

00:11:52.000 --> 00:11:53.040
Indeed.

00:11:54.500 --> 00:11:56.040
That guy is real.

00:11:56.340 --> 00:11:57.210
Yes.

00:11:57.340 --> 00:11:59.880
Maybe he's her brother, zura.

00:12:00.170 --> 00:12:01.050
Her brother?

00:12:01.340 --> 00:12:04.890
Unless I'm mistaken, I don't
think she has a brother.

00:12:05.010 --> 00:12:06.720
So, that means...

00:12:06.850 --> 00:12:09.220
He is You's "Big Demon"!

00:12:09.350 --> 00:12:10.730
She's looking this way!

00:12:16.020 --> 00:12:17.730
Why do we need to hide, zura?

00:12:17.860 --> 00:12:18.900
Because...

00:12:22.860 --> 00:12:23.910
She's gone.

00:12:25.870 --> 00:12:27.240
Let's go after her!

00:12:28.030 --> 00:12:29.910
Good luck.

00:12:37.710 --> 00:12:39.250
Hey, quit squashing me.

00:12:40.210 --> 00:12:41.260
She'll hear us, zura.

00:13:12.750 --> 00:13:13.620
What?

00:13:13.750 --> 00:13:14.960
It was just a cat.

00:13:19.420 --> 00:13:20.800
That was close.

00:13:21.750 --> 00:13:24.300
She almost caught us.

00:13:26.260 --> 00:13:27.470
Yoshiko-chan.

00:13:30.100 --> 00:13:34.310
Your call could not be connected.

00:13:34.430 --> 00:13:36.140
No, that's not it.

00:13:36.940 --> 00:13:38.310
Is something wrong, You-chan?

00:13:39.110 --> 00:13:40.320
Sorry, Tsuki-chan.

00:13:40.770 --> 00:13:42.320
Tsuki-chan?

00:13:43.440 --> 00:13:44.820
Chika-chan?

00:13:44.940 --> 00:13:48.160
That's right. I haven't
introduced you guys.

00:13:48.280 --> 00:13:50.830
This is my first cousin, Tsuki-chan.

00:13:50.950 --> 00:13:51.830
I'm Tsuki.

00:13:51.950 --> 00:13:53.660
Nice to meet you.

00:13:54.120 --> 00:13:55.000
Don't tell me...

00:13:55.790 --> 00:13:56.660
That's a girl?

00:13:57.790 --> 00:13:59.830
What?

00:14:04.130 --> 00:14:06.340
So, you attend that school?

00:14:06.800 --> 00:14:07.680
Yup.

00:14:07.970 --> 00:14:12.180
Before registering, I asked
You-chan to come with me,

00:14:12.310 --> 00:14:15.180
but You-chan said that she wanted to
go to the same school as Chika-chan.

00:14:15.480 --> 00:14:17.190
D-Did I say that?

00:14:17.310 --> 00:14:19.020
It's not something
to be ashamed of.

00:14:19.850 --> 00:14:21.060
You're Riko-chan, aren't you?

00:14:21.190 --> 00:14:22.070
Yes.

00:14:22.190 --> 00:14:24.070
She always talked about you.

00:14:24.190 --> 00:14:25.740
She said she looks up to you.

00:14:26.530 --> 00:14:27.900
No way.

00:14:28.030 --> 00:14:29.740
It's not something
to be ashamed of.

00:14:31.530 --> 00:14:32.410
Chika-chan.

00:14:32.870 --> 00:14:35.240
Ruby-chan, Hanamaru-chan and Yoshiko-chan.

00:14:35.540 --> 00:14:38.250
You-chan really seemed
to like the Aqours,

00:14:38.540 --> 00:14:41.080
so she talked about all
of you every time we met.

00:14:41.710 --> 00:14:43.250
I always get the feeling...

00:14:43.880 --> 00:14:47.090
...that Aqours has already
become a part of You-chan.

00:14:47.670 --> 00:14:50.550
When you put it that way,
I feel quite embarrassed.

00:14:51.890 --> 00:14:53.760
You has always been like that, zura.

00:14:54.060 --> 00:14:55.930
She is really straightforward.

00:14:56.060 --> 00:14:57.930
Why are you looking
at me like that?!

00:14:58.390 --> 00:15:00.270
So, what about the branch school?

00:15:01.900 --> 00:15:02.770
That's right.

00:15:03.060 --> 00:15:04.440
How did it turn out that way?

00:15:07.490 --> 00:15:10.860
Our school has been very active
in club activities for a long time.

00:15:11.070 --> 00:15:14.120
Several clubs have even
participated at national level.

00:15:15.030 --> 00:15:16.080
So?

00:15:17.080 --> 00:15:19.120
When Uranohoshi's students
start at our school,

00:15:19.250 --> 00:15:20.960
the clubs will get sluggish...

00:15:21.420 --> 00:15:25.800
...and some of the parents said
that it might cause conflicts.

00:15:26.750 --> 00:15:27.800
No way.

00:15:27.920 --> 00:15:29.800
Why would it even be that way?

00:15:30.090 --> 00:15:31.130
I know, right?

00:15:31.260 --> 00:15:32.800
We students...

00:15:32.930 --> 00:15:35.810
...as well as the teachers tried to
persuade them not to worry, but...

00:15:36.100 --> 00:15:38.140
...they asked us what we
would do if the clubs went down,

00:15:38.270 --> 00:15:40.140
and whether we
would take responsibility.

00:15:41.440 --> 00:15:44.980
I guess it can't be helped
if they were saying things like that.

00:15:47.110 --> 00:15:50.150
So, we discussed what to do.

00:15:50.780 --> 00:15:52.160
All-out war?

00:15:52.450 --> 00:15:53.990
Don't be ridiculous.

00:15:54.950 --> 00:15:56.990
What they are really worried about,

00:15:57.120 --> 00:16:02.330
is whether Uranohoshi students
will participate actively in clubs.

00:16:02.790 --> 00:16:06.670
So, we should prove to them
that we have club achievements too.

00:16:07.130 --> 00:16:08.170
Club...

00:16:08.460 --> 00:16:10.670
If you put it that way...

00:16:12.300 --> 00:16:14.010
A club like that...

00:16:19.140 --> 00:16:20.350
We have one, don't we?

00:16:21.980 --> 00:16:25.520
A club that won
the national competition.

00:16:28.480 --> 00:16:31.030
Our School Idol club...

00:16:31.150 --> 00:16:34.030
...won't lose out to other
clubs at the new school.

00:16:34.160 --> 00:16:36.870
We will do our best to
actively participate in the clubs,

00:16:36.990 --> 00:16:40.200
and once they change their minds,
they will feel reassured.

00:16:40.540 --> 00:16:41.540
That...

00:16:42.210 --> 00:16:43.040
That's a good idea!

00:16:43.370 --> 00:16:44.370
Isn't it?

00:16:44.540 --> 00:16:46.380
Do you intend to do a live show?

00:16:46.540 --> 00:16:48.040
That's a good idea, but...

00:16:48.210 --> 00:16:51.210
...there's actually a great
event coming up next week!

00:16:52.380 --> 00:16:56.220
T-This is the future, zura!

00:16:56.340 --> 00:16:58.220
Are we really going?

00:17:02.520 --> 00:17:04.890
That girl is really competent!

00:17:05.020 --> 00:17:06.900
She's someone I knew
in my previous life.

00:17:07.020 --> 00:17:07.900
Previous life?

00:17:08.020 --> 00:17:10.190
It's her classmate
from middle school, zura.

00:17:11.730 --> 00:17:14.280
We're doing this for
the school and everyone.

00:17:27.210 --> 00:17:28.750
I'm nervous.

00:17:27.270 --> 00:17:36.030
\h\h\hNew Year

00:17:29.040 --> 00:17:31.090
Isn't this place huge, zura?

00:17:31.550 --> 00:17:33.260
What are you talking about?

00:17:33.550 --> 00:17:37.090
The Love Live! competition stage
was a hundred times bigger!

00:17:38.050 --> 00:17:40.260
And everyone was there back then.

00:17:40.890 --> 00:17:41.930
We're also here.

00:17:42.220 --> 00:17:43.100
Right now.

00:17:46.350 --> 00:17:47.400
Is this everyone?

00:17:48.520 --> 00:17:51.190
We didn't think so,
but maybe six members...

00:17:51.690 --> 00:17:53.070
...isn't enough.

00:17:54.860 --> 00:17:56.900
You-chan, your group is up next.

00:17:57.150 --> 00:17:59.200
I especially asked them
to give you some time.

00:17:59.320 --> 00:18:00.280
Do your best.

00:18:00.660 --> 00:18:01.530
Yes.

00:18:01.830 --> 00:18:04.040
This is for everyone from Uranohoshi.

00:18:04.830 --> 00:18:06.120
That's right.

00:18:06.290 --> 00:18:07.540
It will be fine.

00:18:07.830 --> 00:18:08.870
We can do it.

00:18:13.000 --> 00:18:14.210
From zero to one.

00:18:15.010 --> 00:18:16.380
From one to the next.

00:18:16.840 --> 00:18:17.720
Aqours...

00:18:18.180 --> 00:18:21.390
Sunshine!

00:18:23.510 --> 00:18:24.560
<i>And so,</i>

00:18:23.870 --> 00:18:27.080
New Year

00:18:25.020 --> 00:18:27.890
<i>from this spring, these students
will merge with this school...</i>

00:18:28.020 --> 00:18:30.400
<i>...and Aqours, the School Idol Club
from Uranohoshi Girls High School...</i>

00:18:30.520 --> 00:18:33.070
<i>...will perform a live show.</i>

00:18:36.360 --> 00:18:37.240
<i>This is it.</i>

00:18:38.530 --> 00:18:39.910
<i>Our first...</i>

00:18:40.360 --> 00:18:42.580
<i>...big step forward as the new Aqours.</i>

00:18:42.700 --> 00:18:44.580
<i>Let's step forward
with these six members.</i>

00:18:44.870 --> 00:18:46.160
<i>With six members.</i>

00:18:47.040 --> 00:18:48.000
<i>Six members...</i>

00:19:15.020 --> 00:19:15.980
We failed, didn't we?

00:19:16.690 --> 00:19:19.700
I can't believe we made
a basic mistake like that.

00:19:20.030 --> 00:19:22.870
And it's not as if we were careless.

00:19:23.700 --> 00:19:26.200
I just don't feel at ease, zura...

00:19:26.540 --> 00:19:27.870
...with just six members.

00:19:28.700 --> 00:19:30.160
Sis...

00:19:34.880 --> 00:19:36.710
There they are.

00:19:36.880 --> 00:19:38.050
Chika!

00:19:38.630 --> 00:19:39.550
Mu-chan!

00:19:41.380 --> 00:19:42.220
How was it?

00:19:44.220 --> 00:19:48.560
As expected, they want to make it
a branch school for the time being.

00:19:49.560 --> 00:19:51.060
Of course.

00:19:51.390 --> 00:19:54.560
I'm sorry. If we only did it properly...

00:19:54.900 --> 00:19:57.230
No. You guys didn't do anything wrong.

00:19:57.400 --> 00:19:59.740
On the contrary,
we are the ones at fault.

00:19:59.900 --> 00:20:01.860
During the closure of
our school and this time too,

00:20:01.990 --> 00:20:04.070
we completely relied on
Chika and the others.

00:20:04.410 --> 00:20:05.240
The truth is,

00:20:05.220 --> 00:20:09.080
we can't form a club like Chika's
that everyone would be proud of.

00:20:09.750 --> 00:20:13.750
Because there weren't enough members
and you played several roles.

00:20:13.920 --> 00:20:15.750
It's like a swimming club.

00:20:15.920 --> 00:20:16.750
But...

00:20:16.920 --> 00:20:17.920
For that reason,

00:20:18.750 --> 00:20:21.050
all the more we have to
do a good job, right?

00:20:31.230 --> 00:20:32.270
Here.

00:20:34.600 --> 00:20:35.600
Thank you.

00:20:35.940 --> 00:20:38.270
Everyone from Uranohoshi understands.

00:20:38.770 --> 00:20:40.780
That also said that
an old school isn't too bad.

00:20:40.940 --> 00:20:44.950
Rather, we feel as if
it suits us better.

00:20:45.110 --> 00:20:46.780
- Right.
- Yes, yes.

00:20:46.950 --> 00:20:49.120
- The school suits us, doesn't it?
- Yes.

00:20:53.460 --> 00:20:55.290
Thanks for the grub!

00:20:55.460 --> 00:20:57.630
Hey, eat slowly.

00:20:57.960 --> 00:20:58.790
Okay!

00:21:00.960 --> 00:21:02.800
Six members...

00:21:08.970 --> 00:21:12.640
I feel its been a long time
since we could chat like this.

00:21:14.310 --> 00:21:15.940
Are you still worried about it?

00:21:16.310 --> 00:21:18.650
Not really, but...

00:21:22.150 --> 00:21:23.820
I feel that the School Idol Club...

00:21:23.990 --> 00:21:27.160
...is easily misunderstood
compared to other clubs.

00:21:27.990 --> 00:21:30.160
Since we are always
smiling on stage,

00:21:30.330 --> 00:21:33.000
we might appear frivolous.

00:21:33.160 --> 00:21:35.000
And because we look like
we are having fun,

00:21:35.160 --> 00:21:37.330
they think we are just playing around.

00:21:37.830 --> 00:21:39.000
Is that so?

00:21:40.000 --> 00:21:41.130
But the truth is,

00:21:41.250 --> 00:21:42.840
we dance while we sing.

00:21:43.010 --> 00:21:45.510
And if people saw that we were
uneasy or felt it was hard work,

00:21:45.840 --> 00:21:47.680
they couldn't enjoy
themselves watching us.

00:21:47.840 --> 00:21:51.010
We definitely can't show
them that side of it.

00:21:52.350 --> 00:21:55.230
I guess not giving up
is the only way.

00:21:55.850 --> 00:21:57.850
Even the Uranohoshi student...

00:21:58.020 --> 00:21:59.860
...is trying their best.

00:22:00.020 --> 00:22:01.860
And the School Idol...

00:22:02.190 --> 00:22:06.700
...is doing their best not to
lose out to the new school's clubs.

00:22:08.700 --> 00:22:10.870
I know that, but...

00:22:17.210 --> 00:22:21.250
I was wondering how we
will continue with just six of us.

00:22:22.210 --> 00:22:25.340
When Mari-chan and the others said that we
should continue with just six of us,

00:22:25.670 --> 00:22:27.510
I agreed with them, of course.

00:22:27.880 --> 00:22:29.780
I said "Let's do this!",

00:22:29.780 --> 00:22:31.350
and felt that I'd do my best.

00:22:32.050 --> 00:22:33.720
But when it was really just us,

00:22:34.060 --> 00:22:35.850
I suddenly felt worried.

00:22:36.230 --> 00:22:38.730
Without a doubt, when we
stood on stage back then,

00:22:38.890 --> 00:22:39.850
it hit me, that...

00:22:44.230 --> 00:22:48.240
...Mari-chan, Kanan-chan and Dia-chan
are no longer here.

00:22:50.070 --> 00:22:52.370
What is the new Aqours?

00:22:52.740 --> 00:22:55.910
It is really Aqours without
the three of them?

00:22:57.910 --> 00:22:59.250
What do you want to do...

00:22:59.420 --> 00:23:01.080
...moving forward?

00:23:01.250 --> 00:23:03.090
At this rate,

00:23:03.250 --> 00:23:05.920
Uranohoshi and School Idols will
always be misunderstood.

00:23:07.760 --> 00:23:08.720
But,

00:23:08.920 --> 00:23:10.050
failure is...

00:23:10.260 --> 00:23:12.890
...meant to be
recovered from, isn't it?

00:23:15.100 --> 00:23:17.100
I think there is still time.

00:23:17.430 --> 00:23:18.890
Can we make it on time?

00:23:18.930 --> 00:23:19.940
Yes!

00:23:20.100 --> 00:23:22.610
This time, we have to
do it properly for sure,

00:23:22.730 --> 00:23:24.610
and prove it to those against us.

00:23:26.690 --> 00:23:27.740
A live show?

00:23:28.110 --> 00:23:29.610
Our answer is...

00:23:29.950 --> 00:23:32.910
...something that we can't
find by not moving forward.

00:23:33.120 --> 00:23:34.620
Despite your worries,

00:23:34.950 --> 00:23:36.950
let's do the Love Live! show!

00:23:39.290 --> 00:23:41.290
This isn't like you, Riko-chan.

00:23:42.290 --> 00:23:43.960
We've been together for a year.

00:23:44.130 --> 00:23:46.920
I think I may have been
influenced by someone.

00:23:46.960 --> 00:23:48.550
Who is it?

00:23:50.800 --> 00:23:52.970
I think it's Chika-chan.

00:23:53.300 --> 00:23:54.800
I think...

00:23:54.970 --> 00:23:57.140
...we certainly have
a lot more work to do.

00:23:57.310 --> 00:23:58.810
We have already won.

00:23:59.980 --> 00:24:00.770
But...

00:24:00.810 --> 00:24:02.520
We're still not perfect, you know.

00:24:02.810 --> 00:24:03.770
Really?

00:24:03.810 --> 00:24:05.110
Are we still not perfect?

00:24:07.980 --> 00:24:09.320
You look so happy.

00:24:09.440 --> 00:24:11.150
- Right back at you.
- Yes.

00:24:11.320 --> 00:24:13.990
I think this is more like us.

00:24:14.320 --> 00:24:15.320
Still,

00:24:15.660 --> 00:24:18.620
there is a lot more
we have to do, right?

00:24:19.830 --> 00:24:20.660
Let's run!

00:24:21.330 --> 00:24:22.160
Okay!

00:24:29.460 --> 00:24:32.010
It's too bright, zura...

00:24:32.130 --> 00:24:34.340
We're going to run another round!

00:24:34.510 --> 00:24:36.930
What?!

00:24:37.220 --> 00:24:38.430
One, two,

00:24:38.560 --> 00:24:39.930
three, four.

00:24:40.060 --> 00:24:41.270
Two, two,

00:24:41.390 --> 00:24:42.690
three, four.

00:24:42.730 --> 00:24:44.850
So, where are we going to practice?

00:24:44.900 --> 00:24:48.110
I checked out many places,
but couldn't find one.

00:24:48.270 --> 00:24:50.820
We need to practice here
for the time being.

00:24:50.940 --> 00:24:51.820
Here?

00:24:51.940 --> 00:24:55.200
I feel as if we have
gone back to the beginning.

00:24:55.450 --> 00:24:57.620
- The beginning?
- Zura?

00:24:57.830 --> 00:24:59.870
We had no place to practice,

00:24:59.990 --> 00:25:01.200
there were no club room...

00:25:01.660 --> 00:25:03.040
...and we were coming up
with the group's name.

00:25:03.160 --> 00:25:04.210
Stuff like that.

00:25:04.330 --> 00:25:06.040
When talking with You-chan and Riko-chan

00:25:06.330 --> 00:25:08.040
we practiced here, didn't we?

00:25:08.750 --> 00:25:10.300
Then we found it, right?

00:25:10.590 --> 00:25:11.630
Aqours.

00:25:12.260 --> 00:25:13.130
Yes.

00:25:13.760 --> 00:25:15.300
Long time no see.

00:25:20.760 --> 00:25:22.140
Leah-chan!

00:25:22.270 --> 00:25:24.640
Saint Snow, zura!

00:25:24.810 --> 00:25:26.190
Why are you both here?

00:25:26.310 --> 00:25:29.520
When I emailed them, they
mentioned they were in Tokyo...

00:25:29.650 --> 00:25:31.690
...and I wanted them
to watch our practice.

00:25:31.940 --> 00:25:36.030
Seriously, my sister is
on her graduation trip.

00:25:36.160 --> 00:25:38.660
Please stop calling us all the time.

00:25:38.780 --> 00:25:39.870
Sorry.

00:25:40.330 --> 00:25:41.540
No problem.

00:25:41.790 --> 00:25:44.040
Leah really wanted
to come, you know.

00:25:44.290 --> 00:25:45.160
Sister!

00:25:48.130 --> 00:25:50.840
So, I know this is kind of
abrupt but could you watch us?

00:25:51.130 --> 00:25:53.050
How we are performing right now?

00:25:54.090 --> 00:25:54.920
Yes.

00:26:06.560 --> 00:26:07.560
I see.

00:26:08.690 --> 00:26:09.810
How was it?

00:26:10.060 --> 00:26:11.610
I'll be frank.

00:26:11.940 --> 00:26:14.280
And I believe that is why
you asked us to come here.

00:26:16.400 --> 00:26:17.280
Yes...

00:26:17.780 --> 00:26:21.280
Let's say you win Love Live!
with a performance score of 100,

00:26:22.740 --> 00:26:23.620
right now...

00:26:24.080 --> 00:26:25.620
...your score is just 30.

00:26:25.910 --> 00:26:27.960
Actually, make that 20.

00:26:28.250 --> 00:26:29.120
So low?!

00:26:29.750 --> 00:26:31.790
Not even half of the full mark?

00:26:32.250 --> 00:26:36.630
Was the presence of the three
third years who left so significant?

00:26:37.090 --> 00:26:39.640
Kanan Matsuura's feel
of the rhythm and dance.

00:26:40.090 --> 00:26:41.640
Mari Ohara's singing ability.

00:26:42.140 --> 00:26:44.640
Dia Kurosawa's brilliance
and stage presence.

00:26:44.930 --> 00:26:45.810
Were those...

00:26:46.100 --> 00:26:49.810
...what gave Aqours its
spark and vigour?

00:26:51.110 --> 00:26:52.150
Without them,

00:26:52.480 --> 00:26:54.980
I think you became anxious
and lost your composure.

00:26:55.190 --> 00:26:56.150
It's as if...

00:26:56.320 --> 00:26:59.070
...you are restless and not confident.

00:27:00.990 --> 00:27:03.740
I think you pointed out
our flaws precisely.

00:27:04.700 --> 00:27:05.580
But,

00:27:05.990 --> 00:27:07.160
what should we do?

00:27:09.710 --> 00:27:13.250
This is not something you
can solve by asking others!

00:27:13.500 --> 00:27:15.840
You have to figure it out on your own!

00:27:16.840 --> 00:27:17.760
Leah-chan...

00:27:18.380 --> 00:27:21.090
Our sisters won't be here anymore!

00:27:25.510 --> 00:27:26.350
I'm sorry.

00:27:27.520 --> 00:27:28.350
Is Leah-chan...

00:27:28.730 --> 00:27:31.020
...starting new School Idol group?

00:27:31.730 --> 00:27:34.940
I think that's what
she wants to do, but...

00:27:36.530 --> 00:27:38.820
After saying "Let's start
a new one together",

00:27:38.940 --> 00:27:41.160
she gathered a few people, but...

00:27:41.280 --> 00:27:42.950
...apparently it's not going too well.

00:27:42.990 --> 00:27:46.850
Practice? That much?

00:27:42.990 --> 00:27:46.850
Practice? That much?

00:27:42.990 --> 00:27:46.850
Yep.
For Love Live

00:27:42.990 --> 00:27:46.850
Yep.
For Love Live

00:27:42.990 --> 00:27:46.850
Are you coming tomorrow?

00:27:42.990 --> 00:27:46.850
Are you coming tomorrow?

00:27:42.990 --> 00:27:46.850
Sorry...

00:27:42.990 --> 00:27:46.850
Sorry...

00:27:42.990 --> 00:27:46.850
Let me think about it

00:27:42.990 --> 00:27:46.850
Let me think about it

00:27:43.200 --> 00:27:45.050
Maybe it's because of her character.

00:27:45.050 --> 00:27:46.850
You're one to talk, zura.

00:27:46.850 --> 00:27:47.870
You're annoying!

00:28:06.720 --> 00:28:07.680
I'm sorry.

00:28:09.980 --> 00:28:12.730
You're trying so hard
on your own, Leah-chan.

00:28:14.400 --> 00:28:17.020
Love Live! is not a game!

00:28:33.830 --> 00:28:35.080
W-What's that?

00:28:41.340 --> 00:28:43.760
I've seen that before
somewhere, for sure.

00:28:56.520 --> 00:28:58.400
It's Mari-chan!

00:28:59.320 --> 00:29:00.320
Zura?!

00:29:00.860 --> 00:29:03.360
It's not Mari-chan?

00:29:04.110 --> 00:29:08.080
Thank you for always
looking out for my daughter.

00:29:08.200 --> 00:29:11.080
I am Mari Ohara's mama.

00:29:11.200 --> 00:29:13.750
Mari's mother!

00:29:18.040 --> 00:29:20.130
You can't contact them?

00:29:33.310 --> 00:29:36.310
That's right!

00:29:37.480 --> 00:29:38.810
Before that,

00:29:38.980 --> 00:29:42.150
I heard a lot about
all of you from Mari.

00:29:42.820 --> 00:29:43.650
About the school,

00:29:43.900 --> 00:29:46.320
I really wanted to thank you.

00:29:47.320 --> 00:29:48.160
Even Ruby-chan?

00:29:48.820 --> 00:29:51.660
Ruby felt that since this is a once
in a lifetime graduation trip,

00:29:51.830 --> 00:29:53.950
I decided not to contact anyone.

00:29:54.250 --> 00:29:57.000
Together with "Hug"
and "Desu wa",

00:29:57.330 --> 00:30:01.130
I can't contact the
three of them at all!

00:30:01.420 --> 00:30:03.340
Who are "Hug" and "Desu wa"?

00:30:04.090 --> 00:30:06.680
Unless I am mistaken, she's
referring to Kanan-chan and Dia-chan.

00:30:07.040 --> 00:30:11.440
I believe that all of you will be
able to find Mari and the others,

00:30:11.450 --> 00:30:14.890
for sure!

00:30:22.570 --> 00:30:23.400
Money?

00:30:30.870 --> 00:30:31.780
No way.

00:30:31.910 --> 00:30:34.200
If we find the three of them,
you'll give us this money?

00:30:37.750 --> 00:30:39.120
This is chocolate, zura.

00:30:39.250 --> 00:30:43.630
Yes. It is a performance to show that
I will pay for your transport.

00:30:43.880 --> 00:30:45.210
Of course.

00:30:45.590 --> 00:30:46.550
But...

00:30:46.720 --> 00:30:50.890
if you find them for real,
I have a gift equivalent of this.

00:30:50.660 --> 00:30:52.410
Gift

00:30:51.050 --> 00:30:52.140
So, please do your best.

00:30:52.720 --> 00:30:53.890
Leave it to us!

00:30:54.100 --> 00:30:55.970
If you rely on the eyes...

00:30:56.100 --> 00:30:57.890
...of this fallen angel Yohane,

00:30:58.060 --> 00:31:01.150
finding the three of them
will be a piece of cake!

00:31:01.730 --> 00:31:03.820
Are your eyes blinded by money, zura?

00:31:04.440 --> 00:31:05.730
What do you mean?!

00:31:05.900 --> 00:31:08.150
Obviously, it will be used
for our next live show!

00:31:08.280 --> 00:31:12.070
Live show! Are we going
to do a live show?!

00:31:12.280 --> 00:31:14.240
But we don't know where they are.

00:31:14.410 --> 00:31:16.080
I am also worried about them.

00:31:16.410 --> 00:31:17.660
What do you want to do?

00:31:23.420 --> 00:31:25.250
I think you should go.

00:31:28.760 --> 00:31:32.090
This thought occurred to me
while watching your practice earlier.

00:31:32.430 --> 00:31:34.050
Whatever the reason,

00:31:34.180 --> 00:31:37.930
I think you need to talk
to the three graduates.

00:31:38.850 --> 00:31:39.390
But...

00:31:39.850 --> 00:31:43.730
In order to take the first step
in a new direction,

00:31:43.860 --> 00:31:48.110
it may not be a bad thing to
reflect on what you've done.

00:31:57.830 --> 00:31:59.120
Chika-chan.

00:32:00.120 --> 00:32:02.120
I think Sarah-san is right.

00:32:02.370 --> 00:32:05.090
We can practice for the
live shows wherever we are.

00:32:05.210 --> 00:32:07.630
That's what we have been
doing all along, anyway.

00:32:07.880 --> 00:32:10.130
Don't worry. We can do it!

00:32:14.800 --> 00:32:15.640
Okay!

00:32:15.800 --> 00:32:17.100
Let's go!

00:32:18.430 --> 00:32:19.980
Very, very...

00:32:20.100 --> 00:32:22.140
...thank you!

00:32:23.150 --> 00:32:24.150
So,

00:32:24.310 --> 00:32:25.980
where did the three of them go...

00:32:26.110 --> 00:32:28.320
...for their graduation trip?

00:32:28.480 --> 00:32:30.150
A practice ground to the North...

00:32:30.320 --> 00:32:31.820
...or the land of the mystery South?

00:32:31.990 --> 00:32:32.990
That is...

00:32:33.160 --> 00:32:34.160
That is...

00:32:34.320 --> 00:32:36.830
The three of them travelled to...

00:32:37.120 --> 00:32:40.330
...a place where our
Ohara ancestors lived.

00:32:40.950 --> 00:32:41.830
In other words...

00:32:42.290 --> 00:32:43.330
Could it be...

00:32:46.000 --> 00:32:49.340
Right here!

00:32:48.480 --> 00:32:49.030
Italy

00:32:49.030 --> 00:32:49.570
Italy

00:32:49.570 --> 00:32:50.030
Italy

00:32:50.030 --> 00:32:51.990
Italy

00:32:52.510 --> 00:32:54.280
Yohane's...

00:32:54.300 --> 00:32:55.340
...eyes!

00:33:09.820 --> 00:33:13.360
Onto a foreign land, Yohane...

00:33:14.200 --> 00:33:16.360
Descends!

00:33:20.240 --> 00:33:21.120
We're here!

00:33:21.290 --> 00:33:23.330
That's Pistacchio Buono, zura.

00:33:23.460 --> 00:33:24.330
That was fast!

00:33:24.460 --> 00:33:26.290
There's also chocolate, zura.

00:33:26.460 --> 00:33:28.130
Would you like some, Yoshiko-chan?

00:33:28.250 --> 00:33:29.130
Of course!

00:33:29.630 --> 00:33:33.510
But I remember having a
bad experience after that.

00:33:33.920 --> 00:33:35.340
But I still want to eat!

00:33:36.640 --> 00:33:38.350
So, did they contact you?

00:33:38.600 --> 00:33:40.510
No word from my sis.

00:33:41.100 --> 00:33:43.520
And nothing from Kanan-chan nor Mari-chan.

00:33:43.980 --> 00:33:48.020
I only have this they sent me from
the first place they arrived at.

00:33:48.480 --> 00:33:52.860
So, we ought to head to the
place in this picture first, right?

00:33:52.980 --> 00:33:54.690
This is really close by!

00:33:54.990 --> 00:33:56.200
Do you know this place?

00:33:56.820 --> 00:33:59.530
Yes! Tsuki-chan lived in Italy
when she was young.

00:33:59.660 --> 00:34:01.030
She's very familiar with this place.

00:34:01.160 --> 00:34:02.370
I'll be your tour guide.

00:34:02.490 --> 00:34:05.370
Ask me anything
you're not sure about.

00:34:05.500 --> 00:34:07.870
Now, let's yousoro!

00:34:08.170 --> 00:34:10.540
Hey! That's my line!

00:34:14.010 --> 00:34:15.220
This is amazing.

00:34:15.340 --> 00:34:17.380
There are rivers wherever we go!

00:34:17.510 --> 00:34:20.050
That's because there are
canals all across the town.

00:34:20.510 --> 00:34:22.560
On the other hand,
cars can't pass through.

00:34:23.010 --> 00:34:25.060
Oh, really?

00:34:25.520 --> 00:34:28.230
I feel like I'm lost in the city.

00:34:46.040 --> 00:34:47.250
Here we are.

00:34:49.750 --> 00:34:51.960
Hanamaru-chan!

00:34:52.340 --> 00:34:53.340
There, there.

00:34:53.460 --> 00:34:54.420
That's right.

00:34:57.170 --> 00:34:59.220
This is the place for sure.

00:35:11.860 --> 00:35:13.900
The phone's ringing, isn't it?

00:35:23.370 --> 00:35:25.080
Tsuki-chan.

00:35:27.040 --> 00:35:27.910
Bovolo.

00:35:28.370 --> 00:35:29.250
What?

00:35:29.870 --> 00:35:32.080
It said "Contarini del Bovolo".

00:35:36.050 --> 00:35:38.090
No matter how I look at it,
something feels off.

00:35:39.220 --> 00:35:41.090
Is that a senate?

00:35:41.890 --> 00:35:43.760
Whatever, we're going, zura.

00:35:45.060 --> 00:35:47.270
- Over here?
- Probably.

00:35:51.900 --> 00:35:53.440
What is this?!

00:35:56.900 --> 00:35:57.780
Amazing!

00:35:58.070 --> 00:36:00.450
I feel as if I travelled back
in time to the Middle Ages!

00:36:00.570 --> 00:36:02.950
It is supposed to be at the
top of this building, but...

00:36:04.740 --> 00:36:06.120
Sis!

00:36:06.280 --> 00:36:07.160
Mari-chan!

00:36:07.290 --> 00:36:08.160
Kanan-chan!

00:36:11.290 --> 00:36:12.330
What a relief.

00:36:24.220 --> 00:36:25.390
Sis!

00:36:32.140 --> 00:36:33.850
Sis!

00:36:35.980 --> 00:36:37.860
You actually came all this way.

00:36:37.980 --> 00:36:39.860
To this faraway place.

00:36:40.990 --> 00:36:42.030
I'm so relieved.

00:36:42.320 --> 00:36:44.200
The three of you
were together, right?

00:36:44.320 --> 00:36:45.870
Of course.

00:36:45.990 --> 00:36:47.370
We were always together.

00:36:47.490 --> 00:36:49.200
Why did you go missing?

00:36:49.830 --> 00:36:52.870
Go... Missing?

00:36:54.170 --> 00:36:57.710
I knew it would turn out this way!

00:36:58.170 --> 00:37:00.880
What did Mari's mother say
to Chika and the rest of you?

00:37:01.170 --> 00:37:02.050
Nothing much.

00:37:02.340 --> 00:37:06.050
Just that you went missing
and that she's worried.

00:37:06.720 --> 00:37:08.760
Then who is that?

00:37:08.890 --> 00:37:09.930
Pleasure to meet you.

00:37:10.060 --> 00:37:11.600
I am Tsuki Watanabe.

00:37:11.890 --> 00:37:13.270
You-chan's cousin.

00:37:13.730 --> 00:37:15.600
Nice to meet you!

00:37:16.100 --> 00:37:17.770
Very pretty.

00:37:17.940 --> 00:37:20.110
- She's indeed...
- You-chan's cousin.

00:37:22.940 --> 00:37:24.280
Those stairs...

00:37:24.780 --> 00:37:27.120
I'm seeing stars, zura.

00:37:27.820 --> 00:37:28.870
Hanamaru-chan!

00:37:28.990 --> 00:37:29.700
Good work.

00:37:29.830 --> 00:37:32.870
But Chika, why didn't you
or the others hear anything?

00:37:33.160 --> 00:37:35.370
It means we were
being used as bait.

00:37:36.000 --> 00:37:36.880
Bait?

00:37:37.330 --> 00:37:39.210
If we had known that
Chika-chi and the rest were coming,

00:37:39.340 --> 00:37:41.880
we would definitely
have made contact.

00:37:42.170 --> 00:37:44.050
So, she made a decoy?

00:37:45.180 --> 00:37:47.890
A trap to lure us out!

00:37:48.180 --> 00:37:49.390
What?

00:37:49.510 --> 00:37:52.390
So, what she said about
you going missing was a lie?

00:37:59.860 --> 00:38:02.730
We can't stay here for long.

00:38:06.700 --> 00:38:07.570
You.

00:38:07.910 --> 00:38:09.450
Sorry about this!

00:38:14.500 --> 00:38:16.000
Uniform!

00:38:16.160 --> 00:38:17.120
You can't!

00:38:17.250 --> 00:38:18.500
You can't, zura.

00:38:22.500 --> 00:38:25.840
- She is indeed...
- You-chan's cousin.

00:38:26.510 --> 00:38:27.340
Stop!

00:38:27.510 --> 00:38:29.840
I'm sorry.

00:38:30.010 --> 00:38:32.010
I can't tell you
any details right now!

00:38:33.180 --> 00:38:37.350
Perhaps Mari-chan and the others
are running from her mother, zura.

00:38:37.690 --> 00:38:38.850
Sis.

00:38:39.350 --> 00:38:40.860
Let's give chase!

00:38:41.020 --> 00:38:44.030
That's impossible. We don't even
know where they're headed.

00:38:44.190 --> 00:38:45.190
But...

00:38:46.740 --> 00:38:47.570
What's this?

00:38:48.200 --> 00:38:50.700
When Yohane looks upon the
land that she protects,

00:38:51.030 --> 00:38:54.200
the fairies will lead the way.

00:38:55.040 --> 00:38:56.040
Yohane?

00:38:56.200 --> 00:38:57.040
Not you.

00:38:57.210 --> 00:39:00.210
I think it means there is a saint
named Yohane protecting a place.

00:39:01.380 --> 00:39:03.040
Is there such a place?

00:39:04.300 --> 00:39:05.340
There is.

00:39:05.460 --> 00:39:08.340
The land of Yohane, protected
by Saint Giovanni.

00:39:08.680 --> 00:39:10.050
Let's gather together there.

00:39:10.340 --> 00:39:12.550
Do you really intend
to run like this?

00:39:12.850 --> 00:39:13.720
You don't like it?

00:39:14.180 --> 00:39:16.060
I didn't say that I hate it.

00:39:16.680 --> 00:39:17.890
I like it.

00:39:18.180 --> 00:39:21.230
It's like back when we brought Mari
out to play when we were small.

00:39:21.350 --> 00:39:25.070
You certainly don't look
like a lady, Mari-san.

00:39:25.730 --> 00:39:27.440
Let's go!

00:39:28.190 --> 00:39:29.740
That's...

00:39:29.860 --> 00:39:30.740
...not a bad idea either.

00:39:34.970 --> 00:39:37.340
Acchi ikou ka? (Oh no!)

00:39:34.970 --> 00:39:37.340
Should we go over there? (Oh no!)

00:39:37.350 --> 00:39:39.640
Kocchi ikou ka? (Oh no!)

00:39:37.350 --> 00:39:39.640
Should we go over here? (Oh no!)

00:39:39.640 --> 00:39:44.320
Docchi ikou ka? Wakannai nai nai naai!

00:39:39.640 --> 00:39:44.320
Which way should we go to?
We don-don-don-don't know!

00:39:44.320 --> 00:39:49.210
Go! Zutto jiyuu ni ikitetai tte

00:39:44.320 --> 00:39:49.210
Go! We always want to live with this freedom

00:39:49.210 --> 00:39:52.590
Oh yeah ki ga tsuitan da

00:39:49.210 --> 00:39:52.590
Oh yeah! We just noticed it

00:39:52.590 --> 00:39:58.830
Isoide nigechaou ka? Sou nigechae!

00:39:52.590 --> 00:39:58.830
So come on, should we run away?
Yes we should do it!

00:39:58.830 --> 00:40:03.330
Jama shinaide yo Bye-bye

00:39:58.830 --> 00:40:03.330
Don't try to stop us now
Bye-bye

00:40:03.330 --> 00:40:08.460
Hashiri nagara kangaeta tte

00:40:03.330 --> 00:40:08.460
While we're running around,
thinking without a care

00:40:08.460 --> 00:40:12.940
Ase to aseri de a- mou atsui yo

00:40:08.460 --> 00:40:12.940
Sweaty and impatient
Oh, man it's too hot

00:40:12.940 --> 00:40:17.910
Koe o dashicha mitsukari sou to

00:40:12.940 --> 00:40:17.910
If we break out our voice,
they surely could find us

00:40:17.910 --> 00:40:21.940
Kuchi no katachi de tsutaeru yo

00:40:17.910 --> 00:40:21.940
The shape of our lips should tell it right away

00:40:21.940 --> 00:40:26.850
Nobore orite nobore (meiro mitai na)

00:40:21.940 --> 00:40:26.850
Going up, down, and up again (this looks like a maze)

00:40:26.850 --> 00:40:32.330
Watare magare watare (douro kiken da)

00:40:26.850 --> 00:40:32.330
Crossing here, turning there and again (we are running away)

00:40:32.330 --> 00:40:36.640
Hashiri sugite kurushii no ni

00:40:32.330 --> 00:40:36.640
I think I ran too much and it's getting painful

00:40:36.640 --> 00:40:44.750
Nazeka minna warai dashite tomaranai no

00:40:36.640 --> 00:40:44.750
Why are we all laughing?
We cannot stop it now

00:40:44.750 --> 00:40:48.880
Dakara oikakerareteru hazu ga

00:40:44.750 --> 00:40:48.880
That is why even if I'm the one who's being chased

00:40:48.880 --> 00:40:51.320
Oikaketeru no kamo hontou wa

00:40:48.880 --> 00:40:51.320
Even if you really are chasing me

00:40:51.320 --> 00:40:56.050
Kurukuru tto kurukuru tto saakuru egaite

00:40:51.320 --> 00:40:56.050
Going around and around,
we are drawing a full circle

00:40:56.050 --> 00:41:00.960
Tsukamari takunai keredo tsukamaete mitai ne tte

00:40:56.050 --> 00:41:00.960
Even though I don't want to be caught
I sure look like I want it

00:41:00.960 --> 00:41:10.190
Omoshiroku natte kita yo Runaway forever!?

00:41:00.960 --> 00:41:10.190
This has slowly came to be fun
so Runaway Forever!?

00:41:10.720 --> 00:41:15.630
Motto jiyuu ni ikitetai tte

00:41:10.720 --> 00:41:15.630
We want to live with more of this freedom

00:41:15.630 --> 00:41:18.930
Oh yeah ki ga tsuitan da

00:41:15.630 --> 00:41:18.930
Oh yeah We just noticed it

00:41:18.930 --> 00:41:25.190
Isoide nigechaou ka? Sou nigechae!

00:41:18.930 --> 00:41:25.190
So come on, should we run away?
Yes we should do it!

00:41:25.190 --> 00:41:30.230
Jama shinaide yo Bye-bye

00:41:25.190 --> 00:41:30.230
Don't try to stop us now
Bye-bye

00:41:32.820 --> 00:41:34.860
We've arrived!

00:41:37.410 --> 00:41:39.120
This place is wonderful, isn't it?

00:41:39.780 --> 00:41:42.000
Is this another vacation house
owned by the Ohara family?

00:41:42.120 --> 00:41:43.830
You are wealthy indeed.

00:41:43.960 --> 00:41:46.670
I'd like to agree!
But the truth is,

00:41:46.960 --> 00:41:50.500
I borrowed it from a friend here.

00:41:50.960 --> 00:41:54.840
Perhaps the vacation home owned
by the Ohara family near here,

00:41:54.970 --> 00:41:56.840
is right now...

00:42:00.140 --> 00:42:02.680
...facing a situation like this.

00:42:02.810 --> 00:42:05.890
Those kids!

00:42:06.480 --> 00:42:08.350
Did you deliberately meet with
Chika and the others...

00:42:08.480 --> 00:42:11.190
...to tell them where we were?

00:42:11.440 --> 00:42:12.320
Yes.

00:42:12.440 --> 00:42:15.320
By doing so, they will mistake
us as running away...

00:42:15.610 --> 00:42:18.820
...and look for us at the Ohara
vacation home in a different town.

00:42:19.950 --> 00:42:21.830
You want to buy time, don't you?

00:42:22.450 --> 00:42:24.330
What do you want to do about
Chika and the others?

00:42:24.620 --> 00:42:28.000
Perhaps if they really
understood the message,

00:42:28.120 --> 00:42:30.000
I think they will realise in time.

00:42:30.420 --> 00:42:31.250
But...

00:42:31.420 --> 00:42:33.760
...they actually came all this way,

00:42:33.920 --> 00:42:35.420
when Mari's mother asked them to.

00:42:36.470 --> 00:42:38.840
They ought to forget us,

00:42:39.300 --> 00:42:42.350
and start a new Aqours
like I told them to.

00:42:47.980 --> 00:42:50.350
They're most likely here
not because they were asked to come.

00:42:53.320 --> 00:42:54.360
Maybe...

00:42:54.980 --> 00:42:57.700
...they really have
something to say to us.

00:43:02.470 --> 00:43:08.210
- Yohane... Yohane... Yohane... Yohane...

00:43:02.490 --> 00:43:04.870
- We've arrived at Florence.

00:43:04.870 --> 00:43:05.940
- What should we do?

00:43:05.940 --> 00:43:08.430
- In any case, we need to eat first, zura.

00:43:08.660 --> 00:43:10.040
Agreed!

00:43:19.800 --> 00:43:23.050
- Molto Buono, zura!
- What did you say?

00:43:23.180 --> 00:43:24.890
That means it tastes really good!

00:43:25.010 --> 00:43:28.390
We got the message and
came all the way here.

00:43:28.890 --> 00:43:30.940
Where have Mari-chan
and the others gone?

00:43:31.060 --> 00:43:34.770
Maybe they will
contact us if we wait.

00:43:34.900 --> 00:43:35.780
I wonder if they're here.

00:43:35.900 --> 00:43:37.030
Any news on your mobile?

00:43:37.240 --> 00:43:39.280
Nothing. I guess...

00:43:39.400 --> 00:43:44.120
...if they used their mobiles,
Mari-chan's mother would get an alert.

00:43:44.580 --> 00:43:45.450
That's right.

00:43:49.330 --> 00:43:51.330
Here, sorry to keep you waiting.

00:43:51.540 --> 00:43:53.580
- What's this?
- It's huge!

00:43:53.710 --> 00:43:56.420
This is Bistecca alla Fiorentina.

00:43:56.550 --> 00:43:58.420
It's a popular dish here.

00:43:59.130 --> 00:44:00.840
Thank you for the food!

00:44:00.970 --> 00:44:02.340
Yoshiko-chan, you should try it.

00:44:04.350 --> 00:44:05.390
Where's Yoshiko-chan?

00:44:06.470 --> 00:44:08.020
Yoshiko-chan?

00:44:08.980 --> 00:44:11.850
Yohane-chan!

00:44:11.980 --> 00:44:13.020
She's gone?

00:44:13.350 --> 00:44:14.690
That fallen angel...

00:44:14.860 --> 00:44:17.360
Now she's the one missing.
What should we do?

00:44:17.530 --> 00:44:18.860
Any idea where she could be?

00:44:19.030 --> 00:44:20.360
If there's any place...

00:44:21.200 --> 00:44:22.200
Yohane.

00:44:23.360 --> 00:44:26.580
Yoshiko-chan couldn't stop
talking about Yohane!

00:44:28.200 --> 00:44:29.200
I can't believe it.

00:44:29.370 --> 00:44:30.870
Every single time...

00:44:38.050 --> 00:44:40.380
It's huge!

00:44:41.880 --> 00:44:42.720
What's this?

00:44:42.880 --> 00:44:43.720
It's amazing!

00:44:43.890 --> 00:44:44.890
It's Duomo.

00:44:45.050 --> 00:44:45.890
Dooomo?

00:44:46.220 --> 00:44:49.060
It's the most famous
building in this city.

00:44:49.890 --> 00:44:51.390
Amazing, isn't it?

00:44:51.560 --> 00:44:54.230
Having such a huge building
in the city itself is unbelievable.

00:44:55.060 --> 00:44:56.230
Never mind that.

00:44:56.400 --> 00:44:57.900
Where is that fallen angel?

00:44:58.730 --> 00:44:59.570
She's not here.

00:45:00.400 --> 00:45:01.900
Are you looking for someone?

00:45:03.400 --> 00:45:05.070
Yes, we are.

00:45:05.240 --> 00:45:07.070
She's about Ruby's age.

00:45:07.240 --> 00:45:09.410
She's about the same height too.

00:45:09.580 --> 00:45:10.910
She's always noisy.

00:45:11.250 --> 00:45:14.420
She's a self-professed fallen angel
that is hard to understand, zura.

00:45:15.250 --> 00:45:19.250
I understand. A noble
person like that...

00:45:21.920 --> 00:45:22.920
Yoshiko-chan!

00:45:23.090 --> 00:45:25.090
What are you doing, zura?

00:45:25.260 --> 00:45:27.090
I am not Yoshiko.

00:45:27.260 --> 00:45:28.100
I am Yohane.

00:45:28.430 --> 00:45:30.930
We were really worried about you.

00:45:31.100 --> 00:45:33.100
So, why are you dressed like that?

00:45:33.270 --> 00:45:34.270
You might get arrested.

00:45:34.440 --> 00:45:35.770
Do calm down.

00:45:36.100 --> 00:45:37.270
Ordinary Lili.

00:45:37.440 --> 00:45:39.440
I am more than calm.

00:45:40.070 --> 00:45:41.940
Hey, didn't we agree
not to call me Lili?!

00:45:42.070 --> 00:45:43.440
Right now, I am not...

00:45:43.740 --> 00:45:45.280
...the fallen angel Yohane.

00:45:46.070 --> 00:45:48.120
In this place,
from Yohane's Saint...

00:45:48.240 --> 00:45:52.120
I received an angel's birth!

00:45:54.250 --> 00:45:56.790
The girls in Aqours sure
have varying personalities.

00:45:57.250 --> 00:45:59.130
I regret worrying about her.

00:45:59.420 --> 00:46:02.960
Now, everyone. Let us
follow this angel, Yohane...

00:46:03.090 --> 00:46:05.130
...and aim for heaven over there!

00:46:06.090 --> 00:46:07.470
Heaven?

00:46:07.760 --> 00:46:08.800
That's the cupola.

00:46:09.100 --> 00:46:10.470
It's Duomo's canopy.

00:46:11.060 --> 00:46:14.430
Just for now, for the last time for
today, I have time to guide you.

00:46:14.560 --> 00:46:15.430
Now.

00:46:15.560 --> 00:46:18.440
Please pay me fifteen
Euro per person.

00:46:19.020 --> 00:46:20.270
Are you asking for money?

00:46:20.400 --> 00:46:22.280
Those are just normal tickets!

00:46:22.400 --> 00:46:24.280
You're no angel, zura.

00:46:24.780 --> 00:46:25.650
Kiran!

00:46:30.240 --> 00:46:32.790
It's red roofs everywhere!

00:46:33.240 --> 00:46:35.450
We can't see this
in Japan, can we?

00:46:35.910 --> 00:46:38.120
What a uniform town.

00:46:38.960 --> 00:46:42.000
Yes. It remained this way
for several centuries.

00:46:43.460 --> 00:46:46.510
The stairs here are too high, zura...

00:46:46.630 --> 00:46:50.180
Because this is an old
building, there's no elevator.

00:46:50.470 --> 00:46:51.510
The air is full of it.

00:46:51.640 --> 00:46:53.680
The spirits of Yohane
are sending...

00:46:54.140 --> 00:46:56.350
...whispers of blessings and gospels!

00:46:57.310 --> 00:46:58.190
What's that?

00:46:58.480 --> 00:47:00.190
Fairies winking!

00:47:00.310 --> 00:47:01.190
What is it?

00:47:01.310 --> 00:47:03.190
It looks like a signal.

00:47:03.320 --> 00:47:04.360
When I think about it,

00:47:04.480 --> 00:47:06.360
the path of fairies...

00:47:10.160 --> 00:47:11.200
That light...

00:47:12.490 --> 00:47:13.370
Sis!

00:47:17.330 --> 00:47:18.870
Are they really here?

00:47:20.170 --> 00:47:21.040
Yep.

00:47:21.500 --> 00:47:24.880
Good evening!

00:47:29.260 --> 00:47:30.800
Welcome.

00:47:35.140 --> 00:47:37.180
You weren't followed this time?

00:47:37.310 --> 00:47:38.180
Don't worry.

00:47:38.310 --> 00:47:41.690
We changed our route several
times and hiked up here.

00:47:41.810 --> 00:47:43.020
Sis!

00:47:45.480 --> 00:47:46.360
Even so,

00:47:46.980 --> 00:47:49.030
the fact that you guys
came all this way...

00:47:50.070 --> 00:47:51.910
Did my mother get in touch?

00:47:52.070 --> 00:47:53.910
No, nothing special whatsoever.

00:47:54.080 --> 00:47:55.410
Actually, what happened...

00:47:55.580 --> 00:47:56.410
...with your mother?

00:47:56.910 --> 00:47:58.750
Yes. Just something...

00:47:59.080 --> 00:48:00.410
We came all the way here.

00:48:00.750 --> 00:48:02.920
Tell us, Mari-chan.

00:48:04.200 --> 00:48:06.820
I'm going to feel really bad
for Chika and the others...

00:48:07.050 --> 00:48:09.090
...if you continue hiding it like this.

00:48:11.380 --> 00:48:12.260
But...

00:48:12.720 --> 00:48:13.930
The truth is,

00:48:14.050 --> 00:48:15.760
Mari is getting married.

00:48:20.230 --> 00:48:22.940
- Did you say "fight"?
- That's a battle.

00:48:23.060 --> 00:48:25.270
- The love of cleanliness?
- That's obsession.

00:48:25.560 --> 00:48:26.770
An exciting story?

00:48:26.900 --> 00:48:28.110
That's a masterpiece.

00:48:28.230 --> 00:48:30.280
I'm dying to know the end, zura.

00:48:30.400 --> 00:48:31.950
That's the conclusion.

00:48:32.570 --> 00:48:33.950
Could it be boundaries?

00:48:34.070 --> 00:48:35.620
I said it was marriage.

00:48:40.080 --> 00:48:41.290
M-Marriage?

00:48:41.410 --> 00:48:42.460
Since when?!

00:48:42.580 --> 00:48:44.630
Who are you marrying?!
Who?! Who?! Who?!

00:48:44.750 --> 00:48:46.290
Wait. I'm not getting married.

00:48:46.880 --> 00:48:47.750
What?

00:48:47.880 --> 00:48:49.760
Kanan! Quit fooling around.

00:48:50.050 --> 00:48:52.260
But if you let things
continue like this,

00:48:52.380 --> 00:48:53.590
it's only a matter of time.

00:48:53.720 --> 00:48:56.260
Aren't we doing this to
prevent that from happening?

00:48:56.390 --> 00:48:58.100
I don't understand anymore.

00:48:58.220 --> 00:48:59.270
What do you mean?

00:48:59.390 --> 00:49:02.600
In other words, there has
been an offer of marriage.

00:49:03.060 --> 00:49:06.110
And she has never met
the other party even once.

00:49:06.230 --> 00:49:07.610
Why?

00:49:08.900 --> 00:49:11.780
Because she wants to take
away Mari's freedom.

00:49:13.400 --> 00:49:19.120
Since a long time ago, Mari's mother
didn't like us very much.

00:49:19.410 --> 00:49:22.290
Mari was always
obedient to her mother.

00:49:22.410 --> 00:49:26.960
But after getting to know us,
she started doing as she pleased.

00:49:27.920 --> 00:49:30.800
She returned to Uranohoshi on
her own during high school,

00:49:30.920 --> 00:49:33.130
and even took up the
position of chairwoman.

00:49:33.420 --> 00:49:35.630
And regarding being School Idols,

00:49:35.760 --> 00:49:38.140
she didn't have a
good impression of it.

00:49:38.260 --> 00:49:39.140
Even so...

00:49:39.430 --> 00:49:42.310
So, this graduation trip is...

00:49:42.430 --> 00:49:43.480
Yes.

00:49:43.770 --> 00:49:46.310
I wanted Mama to understand
and wrote her a letter.

00:49:46.440 --> 00:49:49.650
That I'm no longer
the same girl as before.

00:49:50.110 --> 00:49:53.150
And if she doesn't allow me
freedom, I won't go home.

00:49:54.070 --> 00:49:56.450
This is a planned rebellion, isn't it?

00:49:56.570 --> 00:50:00.620
We didn't think she would
seriously pursue us all this way.

00:50:00.780 --> 00:50:02.330
Let's stop fighting, everyone.

00:50:02.950 --> 00:50:04.830
Calm your hearts.

00:50:05.790 --> 00:50:07.000
What are you doing, zura?

00:50:07.120 --> 00:50:08.170
This is the wish...

00:50:09.130 --> 00:50:11.000
...of Angel Yohane.

00:50:15.800 --> 00:50:17.010
Yoshiko-chan!

00:50:17.130 --> 00:50:18.840
Are you okay?

00:50:18.970 --> 00:50:21.680
- What a relief.
- Now you really are a fallen angel.

00:50:22.140 --> 00:50:23.680
What's with the witty jokes?

00:50:23.970 --> 00:50:26.350
Help me!

00:50:26.480 --> 00:50:29.020
Finally, she's back to her normal self, zura.

00:50:40.320 --> 00:50:41.870
The fallen angel calls!

00:50:43.790 --> 00:50:44.660
But...

00:50:44.790 --> 00:50:48.000
if this is her normal self, then
something was wrong from the beginning.

00:50:48.120 --> 00:50:51.170
Please shut up, little demon Lili!

00:50:51.290 --> 00:50:52.840
Stop calling me Lili!

00:50:52.960 --> 00:50:54.000
Anyway,

00:50:54.130 --> 00:50:57.170
