the others into our next step.

00:50:57.630 --> 00:50:59.340
We need a proper plan.

00:50:59.470 --> 00:51:00.510
Indeed.

00:51:06.980 --> 00:51:08.020
M-Mama?

00:51:09.140 --> 00:51:11.020
Hiding out in a place like this...

00:51:11.230 --> 00:51:12.860
Was it another of "Hug's" ideas?

00:51:12.980 --> 00:51:14.190
No, it wasn't!

00:51:14.480 --> 00:51:16.190
It was my idea.

00:51:16.320 --> 00:51:18.030
Because you were
being difficult, Mama.

00:51:18.490 --> 00:51:21.200
Because I wasn't difficult,
you turned out this way.

00:51:21.490 --> 00:51:24.200
At the time you ran away from
home during elementary school...

00:51:24.330 --> 00:51:25.540
...and to save your school,

00:51:25.660 --> 00:51:28.870
...you quit high school here
to return to Uranohoshi.

00:51:29.500 --> 00:51:31.380
