00:52:18.210 --> 00:52:20.800
Whatever Mari does is up to me to--

00:52:20.920 --> 00:52:22.180
It's not worthless!

00:52:23.340 --> 00:52:24.180
Mari?

00:52:24.850 --> 00:52:25.850
School Idols...

00:52:26.180 --> 00:52:27.350
...are not worthless!

00:52:28.850 --> 00:52:31.850
If I can prove that
School Idols are not worthless...

00:52:32.140 --> 00:52:35.360
...and capable of great things,

00:52:35.480 --> 00:52:37.980
please let me do as I wish.

00:52:38.860 --> 00:52:40.030
If I can show you...

00:52:40.190 --> 00:52:44.030
...that School Idols are able
to touch the hearts of others,

00:52:44.530 --> 00:52:46.200
would you acknowledge me, Mama?

00:52:46.870 --> 00:52:48.540
Would you stop
the marriage offer,

00:52:48.870 --> 00:52:52.210
