00:53:42.220 --> 00:53:43.260
Sister, please...

00:53:43.420 --> 00:53:45.930
...turn off the lights.

00:53:48.100 --> 00:53:49.100
Leah.

00:53:56.770 --> 00:53:58.110
Buongiorno!

00:53:58.440 --> 00:54:01.000
"Good evening" is "Buonasera", you know.

00:54:03.070 --> 00:54:05.450
Ottimo, zura.

00:54:05.610 --> 00:54:07.450
Seriously, what's up with you?

00:54:07.950 --> 00:54:10.950
You ate so much
but haven't changed a bit.

00:54:11.120 --> 00:54:12.290
