00:56:53.990 --> 00:56:55.870
I agree with what you said, Chika.

00:56:56.830 --> 00:56:58.870
That you need to find it yourselves.

00:56:59.490 --> 00:57:00.370
That's right.

00:57:00.660 --> 00:57:03.210
There will be no meaning
if you take our opinion.

00:57:03.830 --> 00:57:05.040
I guess so.

00:57:05.170 --> 00:57:06.040
But...

00:57:09.340 --> 00:57:12.050
But our feelings will always be here.

00:57:12.340 --> 00:57:13.880
Mari's,

00:57:14.340 --> 00:57:15.220
Dia's...

00:57:16.010 --> 00:57:17.220
