00:57:17.680 --> 00:57:19.720
They won't change and
will always be here.

00:57:20.020 --> 00:57:20.890
Always?

00:57:21.480 --> 00:57:22.810
Yes.

00:57:22.980 --> 00:57:23.980
Always.

00:57:27.150 --> 00:57:29.650
Right! We have an early start
tomorrow, so let's go to bed.

00:57:30.150 --> 00:57:31.320
Good night.

