00:59:51.040 --> 00:59:53.080
Minna ga ne daisuki da!

00:59:51.040 --> 00:59:53.080
Everyone here
we love you!

00:59:56.780 --> 00:59:58.670
Minna ga ne daisuki da!

00:59:56.780 --> 00:59:58.670
Everyone here
we love you!

00:59:58.670 --> 01:00:04.510
Kotoba o uta ni noseta toki ni

00:59:58.670 --> 01:00:04.510
The times I put my words into a song like this

01:00:04.510 --> 01:00:14.410
Tsutawatteku kono omoi zutto wasurenai

01:00:04.510 --> 01:00:14.410
I pour all my feelings on it
don't ever forget it!

01:00:14.410 --> 01:00:17.710
Wakuwaku shitakute sasetakute

01:00:14.410 --> 01:00:17.710
Thrilled and full of joy
let's all do it

01:00:17.710 --> 01:00:23.550
Odoreba hitotsu ni naru yo sekaijuu ga

01:00:17.710 --> 01:00:23.550
If we dance we will come as on around the world

01:00:23.550 --> 01:00:25.180
Come on! Come on! Come on!

01:00:25.180 --> 01:00:26.340
Atsuku naare!!

01:00:25.180 --> 01:00:26.340
Let's get together!

01:00:26.340 --> 01:00:29.400
Wakuwaku shitakute sasechau yo

01:00:26.340 --> 01:00:29.400
Thrilled and full of emotion
you should do it

01:00:29.400 --> 01:00:35.110
Odoreba kokoro tsunagatteku minna to

01:00:29.400 --> 01:00:35.110
Let your heart dance along and connect with everyone

01:00:35.110 --> 01:00:41.840
Konna suteki na koto yamerarenai souda yo!

01:00:35.110 --> 01:00:41.840
This is something lovely we'll never stop to do
Yeah, that's right!

01:00:41.840 --> 01:00:44.640
Nonstop nonstop the music

01:00:44.640 --> 01:00:50.870
Nonstop nonstop the hopping heart

01:00:59.360 --> 01:01:00.190
Sis.

01:01:00.530 --> 01:01:03.200
Ruby can do anything.

01:01:03.530 --> 01:01:04.360
Anything!

01:01:05.200 --> 01:01:06.030
Yeah!

01:01:06.530 --> 01:01:08.870
What made you choose
The Spanish Steps?

01:01:09.040 --> 01:01:10.040
Because...

01:01:10.200 --> 01:01:14.370
...it resembles the stone stairs
we have at the beach in Numazu, zura!

01:01:19.550 --> 01:01:20.380
Mari.

01:01:23.880 --> 01:01:24.720
Mama.

01:01:26.550 --> 01:01:29.220
The steps that I have taken
with everyone up till now...

01:01:29.890 --> 01:01:31.890
...are all a part of me,

01:01:32.390 --> 01:01:34.230
and define who I am.

01:01:35.230 --> 01:01:38.060
Just like how Mama and
Papa have raised me,

01:01:38.230 --> 01:01:40.400
everyone in Aqours
has also raised me.

01:01:40.780 --> 01:01:44.320
That is why I can't let anything go.

01:01:44.820 --> 01:01:47.070
This is who I am right now.

01:01:57.580 --> 01:01:58.420
What was that about?

01:01:58.590 --> 01:01:59.420
No idea.

01:02:04.930 --> 01:02:05.930
But...

01:02:06.930 --> 01:02:09.100
I think she understands.

01:02:18.440 --> 01:02:20.440
Yohane is back!

01:02:21.270 --> 01:02:22.780
I'm tired, zura.

01:02:22.940 --> 01:02:24.280
Wait for me!

01:02:24.380 --> 01:02:26.130
Seishin High School

01:02:24.380 --> 01:02:26.130
Uranohoshi Girls' High School branch school

01:02:30.280 --> 01:02:31.790
There's no one here, zura.

01:02:32.120 --> 01:02:36.290
But Mu-chan and the others
told us to come here.

01:02:38.460 --> 01:02:39.960
Welcome home!

01:02:41.800 --> 01:02:45.130
Sorry to ask you to help us
conduct the live performance.

01:02:45.470 --> 01:02:46.970
No problem at all!

01:02:47.130 --> 01:02:49.800
When I contacted everyone
after getting your message,

01:02:49.940 --> 01:02:52.140
they all said they
would cooperate.

01:02:53.310 --> 01:02:56.140
Actually, even the
stage image is complete!

01:02:56.480 --> 01:02:57.310
Really?

01:02:57.640 --> 01:02:59.810
You're in for a surprise!

01:02:59.980 --> 01:03:01.310
Here it is!

01:03:01.940 --> 01:03:03.610
Ta-da!

01:03:05.820 --> 01:03:06.820
Well?

01:03:06.990 --> 01:03:07.990
It's amazing!

01:03:08.150 --> 01:03:10.160
But such a splendid stage...

01:03:10.320 --> 01:03:11.830
It's so splendid,

01:03:11.990 --> 01:03:13.160
but we didn't have enough time.

01:03:13.330 --> 01:03:15.160
That's what I said too, but...

01:03:15.330 --> 01:03:17.160
After everyone had discussed it,

01:03:17.330 --> 01:03:20.670
we all wanted to build
a great stage worthy of Aqours.

01:03:21.170 --> 01:03:24.340
We also want to prove
that Uranohoshi is competent.

01:03:25.010 --> 01:03:27.510
But what about the sound personnel
for the live performance,

01:03:27.670 --> 01:03:29.510
we're short on manpower.

01:03:30.180 --> 01:03:31.510
Hello.

01:03:31.850 --> 01:03:32.850
Nice to meet you!

01:03:36.890 --> 01:03:39.270
They came and spoke with me.

01:03:39.480 --> 01:03:41.860
Some parents are still
opposed to this, but...

01:03:41.980 --> 01:03:43.520
...they said that they
wish to cooperate.

01:03:44.320 --> 01:03:46.030
It's still not enough, though.

01:03:47.320 --> 01:03:49.360
You truly are the
student representative!

01:03:49.990 --> 01:03:51.030
Thank you.

01:03:52.820 --> 01:03:53.870
Could you be...

01:03:53.990 --> 01:03:55.870
- Yohane-chan?
- You're mistaken!

01:03:55.990 --> 01:03:58.040
I went to the same
middle school as you!

01:03:59.830 --> 01:04:02.040
I always watched you online.

01:04:03.000 --> 01:04:04.880
The advent of Yohane!

01:04:10.510 --> 01:04:12.890
We just got them to support us.

01:04:13.010 --> 01:04:15.060
It would look bad if you ran off.

01:04:16.060 --> 01:04:16.890
You're so annoying!

01:04:17.390 --> 01:04:19.890
Want to take pictures together,

01:04:20.060 --> 01:04:20.890
Yohane-chan?

01:04:21.060 --> 01:04:22.230
W-What's this about?

01:04:22.400 --> 01:04:24.230
- For real?
- We want to take pictures!

01:04:24.400 --> 01:04:25.230
Wait!

01:04:27.730 --> 01:04:29.070
We won't let you escape.

01:04:29.240 --> 01:04:30.740
Do your best, zura.

01:04:31.740 --> 01:04:32.570
H-How mean!

01:04:32.740 --> 01:04:35.240
I've been betrayed by little demons!

01:04:36.910 --> 01:04:37.740
Thank you!

01:04:37.910 --> 01:04:38.910
I'll treasure this.

01:04:39.910 --> 01:04:41.080
Don't worry about it.

01:04:41.750 --> 01:04:44.250
Give me your ID, so that
I can send you pictures.

01:04:48.550 --> 01:04:50.390
Transferring contact info

01:04:48.840 --> 01:04:50.470
Shake shake

01:04:50.760 --> 01:04:51.590
Thanks!

01:04:52.010 --> 01:04:53.220
Let's work together.

01:05:00.680 --> 01:05:02.730
All right, let's do this!

01:05:03.190 --> 01:05:06.060
But it will be different from
the last time we sang there.

01:05:06.520 --> 01:05:08.570
Mari-chan and the others aren't here, zura.

01:05:10.190 --> 01:05:11.070
We can do it.

01:05:11.860 --> 01:05:12.740
We can do it!

01:05:13.860 --> 01:05:14.910
Ruby-chan.

01:05:15.870 --> 01:05:16.910
I can do it too.

01:05:17.370 --> 01:05:18.240
And Chika-chan too?

01:05:18.540 --> 01:05:19.410
Yes.

01:05:23.040 --> 01:05:25.210
We need to work hard, too.

01:05:25.330 --> 01:05:27.040
Speaking of that,
where are our souvenirs?

01:05:27.170 --> 01:05:28.040
Oh, I forgot.

01:05:28.340 --> 01:05:29.710
What?!

01:05:30.710 --> 01:05:35.260
But still, I never imagined the
new school to be like that.

01:05:35.550 --> 01:05:37.930
They should have told us in detail.

01:05:38.220 --> 01:05:40.770
If I had known the
situation, I could have helped.

01:05:41.060 --> 01:05:41.930
That is...

01:05:42.890 --> 01:05:44.940
It's something that they need
to solve on their own, right?

01:05:46.810 --> 01:05:47.650
What's wrong?

01:05:47.980 --> 01:05:49.650
This is so boring!

01:05:49.820 --> 01:05:51.820
Becuase we can't do anything.

01:05:52.320 --> 01:05:53.820
It can't be helped, can it?

01:05:53.990 --> 01:05:55.990
We've graduated, after all.

01:05:56.990 --> 01:06:00.830
Chika and the others said they want
us to watch their live performance.

01:06:01.330 --> 01:06:03.000
I know that.

01:06:06.170 --> 01:06:07.330
This is...

01:06:09.170 --> 01:06:10.840
Here, you should play
well with each other.

01:06:11.340 --> 01:06:12.840
Please be quiet for a while.

01:06:13.670 --> 01:06:15.180
Because Chika-chan needs to concentrate.

01:06:17.010 --> 01:06:17.840
Sit.

01:06:20.390 --> 01:06:21.310
Sit.

01:06:22.180 --> 01:06:23.520
Sit!

01:06:24.350 --> 01:06:27.020
Be obedient for once!

01:06:45.710 --> 01:06:47.040
Everything seems
to be going well.

01:06:48.710 --> 01:06:49.540
Sorry.

01:06:53.670 --> 01:06:56.380
Somehow, I feel like...

01:06:57.340 --> 01:06:59.220
...I understand how we should start.

01:07:00.090 --> 01:07:02.310
Do you mean Aqours
with six members?

01:07:03.770 --> 01:07:07.480
I always thought of starting
as something you do from zero.

01:07:08.230 --> 01:07:10.400
We start from zero,

01:07:10.520 --> 01:07:12.070
and that is why it is called a start.

01:07:12.190 --> 01:07:13.230
Is that wrong?

01:07:15.360 --> 01:07:16.240
It's wrong.

01:07:17.200 --> 01:07:18.740
Because if we were
to start from zero,

01:07:18.860 --> 01:07:21.240
all our experiences to date
would be insignificant, right?

01:07:22.030 --> 01:07:23.740
And that's not the case at all.

01:07:24.870 --> 01:07:28.080
Everything I've done
before still remains.

01:07:29.000 --> 01:07:31.880
Not a single thing has disappeared.

01:07:34.610 --> 01:07:38.780
Lyrics Notebook

01:07:34.610 --> 01:07:38.780
No peeking!!

01:07:34.610 --> 01:07:38.780
Or face the mikan's
punishment!

01:07:35.410 --> 01:07:36.990
If you think of it that way,

01:07:36.990 --> 01:07:38.580
I feel like I can do this.

01:07:40.130 --> 01:07:41.680
I'm looking forward to your lyrics.

01:07:41.970 --> 01:07:43.680
Please compose a good song.

01:07:43.810 --> 01:07:44.600
Of course.

01:07:44.810 --> 01:07:48.350
Everyday, I'm learning how
to compose songs.

01:07:49.810 --> 01:07:52.860
When over there, I listened
to music whenever I had time.

01:07:54.150 --> 01:07:55.020
I see.

01:07:55.980 --> 01:07:57.030
We're not the only ones working hard.

01:07:57.820 --> 01:07:59.200
Ruby-chan and Hanamaru-chan...

01:07:59.650 --> 01:08:02.740
...went to the textiles shop to
make reference for our outfits.

01:08:03.160 --> 01:08:08.120
Also, You-chan and Yoshiko-chan were working
hard at new dance choreography.

01:08:09.160 --> 01:08:10.040
Really?

01:08:10.620 --> 01:08:12.500
Aqours really is amazing.

01:08:12.830 --> 01:08:13.710
It's great, isn't it?

01:08:14.000 --> 01:08:15.880
Being the leader of such a group.

01:08:16.170 --> 01:08:17.050
It's great!

01:08:20.170 --> 01:08:21.050
Chika-chan!

01:08:22.180 --> 01:08:23.050
What is it?

01:08:23.340 --> 01:08:24.890
Kanan-chan's on the phone.

01:08:25.180 --> 01:08:26.060
What?

01:08:26.850 --> 01:08:28.220
My battery is flat.

01:08:31.560 --> 01:08:35.940
Leah-chan wants to join Aqours?

01:08:36.230 --> 01:08:38.440
In other words,
she wants to transfer schools?

01:08:38.570 --> 01:08:39.440
Yes.

01:08:39.900 --> 01:08:41.610
If the application is
processed in spring,

01:08:41.740 --> 01:08:45.120
she will make it in time to
attend school with all of you.

01:08:45.580 --> 01:08:47.120
And you are all familiar with her.

01:08:48.910 --> 01:08:51.120
Did Leah-chan herself say that
is what she wants?

01:08:51.250 --> 01:08:52.120
No.

01:08:52.250 --> 01:08:53.630
They haven't spoken yet.

01:08:54.420 --> 01:08:57.960
But Sarah believes
that is the best way.

01:08:59.090 --> 01:09:03.640
She called to ask our opinion
as a fellow graduate.

01:09:04.260 --> 01:09:07.470
I think it's one thing
to talk to Sarah,

01:09:08.260 --> 01:09:11.310
but how Chika and the
others feel is also important.

01:09:12.940 --> 01:09:13.810
So, Leah-chan...

01:09:14.270 --> 01:09:15.810
Wants to join Aqours.

01:09:16.440 --> 01:09:17.980
Just thinking of it...

01:09:21.280 --> 01:09:22.820
<i>You call that a step?</i>

01:09:22.950 --> 01:09:26.160
<i>Being a School Idol is not a game, Yoshiko!</i>

01:09:26.950 --> 01:09:29.330
I'm not Yoshiko, I'm Yohane!

01:09:29.790 --> 01:09:31.330
What were you imagining, zura?

01:09:32.460 --> 01:09:33.330
What do you think?

01:09:33.960 --> 01:09:36.000
I don't mind the idea at all.

01:09:36.460 --> 01:09:38.340
I mean, we talked about this.

01:09:38.630 --> 01:09:41.840
Aqours doesn't depend on
how many members we have.

01:09:42.130 --> 01:09:43.010
Also,

01:09:43.130 --> 01:09:45.840
Leah-chan is our friend who competed
in Love Live! like we did.

01:09:46.470 --> 01:09:47.510
It sounds fine, doesn't it?

01:09:47.970 --> 01:09:49.350
But somehow I feel
this will cause trouble.

01:09:49.470 --> 01:09:54.020
She could contribute
a lot more than Yoshiko-chan, zura.

01:09:56.480 --> 01:09:57.520
It's just that...

01:09:58.310 --> 01:09:59.520
I'm against it.

01:10:01.150 --> 01:10:04.530
I think that this is definitely
not what Leah-chan wants.

01:10:05.320 --> 01:10:09.370
I don't think her problems can be
solved even if she joins Aqours.

01:10:10.990 --> 01:10:12.370
Why do you feel that way?

01:10:12.830 --> 01:10:16.040
Because after Saint Snow dissolved,

01:10:16.330 --> 01:10:18.210
Leah-chan started a new group.

01:10:19.340 --> 01:10:23.210
She wanted to preserve the memory
of Saint Snow that she did with her sis...

01:10:23.510 --> 01:10:26.050
that's why she
started a new group.

01:10:26.340 --> 01:10:29.890
For that reason, I don't think
she wants to join Aqours.

01:10:32.350 --> 01:10:33.220
Ruby.

01:10:33.350 --> 01:10:36.560
I sang together with my sis
before, so I know the feeling.

01:10:38.350 --> 01:10:40.900
My sis and the
others are not gone.

01:10:42.860 --> 01:10:46.400
Even if we are not standing on
the same stage, we are together.

01:10:48.700 --> 01:10:49.570
Together?

01:10:53.040 --> 01:10:56.580
I guess Leah-chan just
hasn't realised yet...

01:11:00.210 --> 01:11:04.090
...that she needs to do something
to fill the void of Sarah-san not being there.

01:11:05.210 --> 01:11:08.760
She tried to do all she could
to replicate Saint Snow.

01:11:09.930 --> 01:11:13.140
Because she didn't win
Love Live! with her sis,

01:11:13.260 --> 01:11:14.970
she is bent on winning it...

01:11:15.100 --> 01:11:16.980
...because she feels
guilty towards Sarah-sen.

01:11:22.270 --> 01:11:26.990
I think perhaps you are the one who
truly understands how Leah feels, Ruby.

01:11:27.780 --> 01:11:29.160
Your sister also graduated,

01:11:29.450 --> 01:11:31.320
so you have a lot in common.

01:11:37.290 --> 01:11:39.170
I agree with Ruby-chan, zura.

01:11:39.790 --> 01:11:40.670
Same here.

01:11:40.960 --> 01:11:41.830
Yes!

01:11:43.130 --> 01:11:45.000
If so, what should we do?

01:11:47.970 --> 01:11:48.840
That's right.

01:11:50.130 --> 01:11:52.350
I think the best way
is to just tell her.

01:11:52.970 --> 01:11:53.850
Right.

01:11:54.470 --> 01:11:55.680
We're with you.

01:11:55.810 --> 01:11:57.850
And we will always be with you.

01:11:58.140 --> 01:12:01.190
Let's make Leah's
biggest dream come true.

01:12:02.980 --> 01:12:03.860
Dream.

01:12:04.480 --> 01:12:05.360
That's it.

01:12:05.480 --> 01:12:06.360
Dream!

01:12:07.150 --> 01:12:10.030
I think everyone has
the same idea.

01:12:13.990 --> 01:12:18.040
The dream that Leah-chan couldn't
achieve, no matter what she did.

01:12:18.830 --> 01:12:20.370
That's right.

01:12:20.830 --> 01:12:22.210
Let's make it come true.

01:12:22.500 --> 01:12:23.380
Together!

01:12:24.500 --> 01:12:26.710
We need to tell Sarah-san right away.

