01:12:45.880 --> 01:12:48.760
You want to quit?

01:12:45.880 --> 01:12:48.760
You want to quit?

01:12:45.880 --> 01:12:48.760
I see. Thanks for everything.

01:12:45.880 --> 01:12:48.760
I see. Thanks for everything.

01:12:47.880 --> 01:12:48.740
Sister.

01:12:49.360 --> 01:12:50.400
<i>It was our biggest dream.</i>

01:13:01.210 --> 01:13:03.920
<i>And I ruined it.</i>

01:13:08.210 --> 01:13:09.090
<i>Sister.</i>

01:13:12.470 --> 01:13:13.680
<i>Sister!</i>

01:13:18.810 --> 01:13:21.350
<i>To think that Saint Snow lost...</i>

01:13:21.640 --> 01:13:23.690
<i>They were supposed to win.</i>

01:13:25.400 --> 01:13:27.440
<i>I don't know what happened.</i>

01:13:30.400 --> 01:13:31.940
<i>Leah!</i>

01:14:00.600 --> 01:14:01.470
Sister.

01:14:05.270 --> 01:14:07.480
Why are you dressed like that?

01:14:09.230 --> 01:14:13.950
<i>Now, we will conduct the
final round of Love Live!</i>

01:14:15.990 --> 01:14:18.660
<i>Let me introduce the two
groups in the finals.</i>

01:14:18.820 --> 01:14:19.830
Amazing.

01:14:19.990 --> 01:14:22.160
- She's in such high spirits.
- We might lose.

01:14:22.500 --> 01:14:25.160
First up, starting afresh
from Uranohoshi.

01:14:25.330 --> 01:14:29.170
<i>This may be their first appearance,
but they are second to none!</i>

01:14:29.340 --> 01:14:31.340
<i>School Idols, Aqours!</i>

01:14:34.340 --> 01:14:36.180
<i>And the other group is...</i>

01:14:36.510 --> 01:14:38.340
<i>...a superstar born in the North.</i>

01:14:38.840 --> 01:14:40.680
<i>Saint Snow!</i>

01:14:42.180 --> 01:14:46.350
We are going to hold a
Love Live! competition just for us.

01:14:50.020 --> 01:14:52.860
If we are going to
be on stage for the finals,

01:14:53.190 --> 01:14:56.700
we need to decide on our
outfits and dance steps.

01:15:03.870 --> 01:15:04.700
Sister.

01:15:05.200 --> 01:15:08.210
If we're going to
compete against Aqours...

01:15:09.130 --> 01:15:12.170
...and if you manage
to be on stage,

